":"Group yoga"},{"type":"h","text":"Health education"},{"type":"h","text":"Stress-management workshops"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle programs"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive-health sessions"},{"type":"h","text":"Community wellness campaigns"}]},{"heading":"Clinical Documentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional therapist should maintain:"},{"type":"h","text":"Initial assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical history relevant to the program"},{"type":"h","text":"Goals"},{"type":"h","text":"Session plan"},{"type":"h","text":"Practice modifications"},{"type":"h","text":"Attendance"},{"type":"h","text":"Progress notes"},{"type":"h","text":"Adverse-event records"},{"type":"h","text":"Referral notes"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-up assessments"},{"type":"p","text":"Good documentation improves continuity of care and professional accountability."}]},{"heading":"Safety & Contraindication Awareness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong therapist must know when not to perform a practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Important considerations include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Acute injury"},{"type":"h","text":"Severe pain"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular instability"},{"type":"h","text":"Neurological symptoms"},{"type":"h","text":"Recent surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Pregnancy-specific risks"},{"type":"h","text":"Severe dizziness"},{"type":"h","text":"Acute illness"},{"type":"h","text":"Significant respiratory distress"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Client Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk Screening"},{"type":"h","text":"Identify Contraindications"},{"type":"h","text":"Modify / Avoid Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Clearance if Needed"},{"type":"h","text":"Therapeutic Session"},{"type":"h","text":"Monitor Response"},{"type":"p","text":"The therapist should refer clients when symptoms exceed the appropriate scope of practice."}]},{"heading":"Research & Evidence-Based Practice","kind":"other","blocks":